{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 17,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear the right, O Jehovah, attend unto my cry;\nGive ear unto my prayer, that goeth not out of feigned lips.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let my sentence come forth from thy presence;Let thine eyes look upon equity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast proved my heart; thou hast visited me in the night;\nThou hast tried me, and findest nothing;\nI am purposed that my mouth shall not transgress.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for the works of men, by the word of thy lips\nI have kept me from the ways of the violent.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My steps have held fast to thy paths,\nMy feet have not slipped.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have called upon thee, for thou wilt answer me, O God:\nIncline thine ear unto me, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hear my speech.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Show thy marvellous lovingkindness,\nO thou that savest by thy right hand them that take refuge ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in thee",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nFrom those that rise up ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "against them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep me as the apple of the eye;\nHide me under the shadow of thy wings,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From the wicked that oppress me,\nMy deadly enemies, that compass me about.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are inclosed in their own fat:\nWith their mouth they speak proudly.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have now compassed us in our steps;\nThey set their eyes to cast ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "us",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " down to the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He is like a lion that is greedy of his prey,\nAnd as it were a young lion lurking in secret places.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Arise, O Jehovah,Confront him, cast him down:\nDeliver my soul from the wicked by thy sword;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From men by thy hand, O Jehovah,\nFrom men of the world, whose portion is in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " life,\nAnd whose belly thou fillest with thy treasure:\nThey are satisfied with children,\nAnd leave the rest of their substance to their babes.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.17.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.17.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for me, I shall behold thy face in righteousness;I shall be satisfied, when I awake, with ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "beholding",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy form.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Prayer for protection against oppressors.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "A Prayer of David.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
